`Measuring the Hubble Constant Using Strongly Lensed Gravitational Wave Signals'","authors":["Jason S. C. Poon","Otto A. Hannuksela"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文是对Huang等人(JCAP08(2023)003)工作的质疑评论。Huang等人声称仅凭透镜红移就能从透镜引力波事件中约束哈勃常数，但本文指出这一结论有误，因为在缺乏源红移或爱因斯坦半径信息的情况下，哈勃常数实际上无法被测量。","date":"2026-09-01","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28765","score":92,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"gravitational lens modelling","points":28}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.28430","canonical_id":"2608.28430","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Follow-up of SN 2025wny V: Lens Modelling and Cosmography of a Strongly Lensed Superluminous Supernova at $z = 2.015$ using Space Data","authors":["Edvard Mörtsell","Joel Johansson","Ariel Goobar","Alice Townsend","Hannah C. Turner","Suhail Dhawan","Cameron Lemon","Peter Nugent","Thomas E. Collett","Stephen Thorp","Jacob Osman Hjortlund","Jakob Nordin","Lin Yan","Graham P. Smith","Christoffer Fremling"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文对红移z=2.015的强透镜型超亮超新星SN 2025wny进行了透镜与宇宙学分析，利用HST和JWST成像构建双椭圆幂律质量分布加外部剪切模型，结合时间延迟测量得到H0=66.7^{+7.6}_{-6.3} km/s/Mpc（等温剖面）或70.8^{+8.2}_{-6.1} km/s/Mpc（斜率可变），与现有宇宙学测量基本一致。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28430","score":92,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.28427","canonical_id":"2608.28427","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Follow-up of SN 2025wny IV: Photometric Time-delay Measurements of a Strongly Lensed Superluminous Supernova","authors":["Alice Townsend","Suhail Dhawan","Erin E. Hayes","Maggie L. Li","Joel Johansson","Edvard Mörtsell","Ariel Goobar","Lin Yan","Charlotte Ward","Veena Krishnaraj","Steve Schulze","Jacob Osman Hjortlund","Yu-Jing Qin","Hannah C. Turner","Peter Massey","Jakob Nordin","Jule Augustin","Aleksandra Bochenek","Malte Busmann","Christoffer Fremling","Daniel Gruen","Xander J. Hall","K. -R. Hinds","Ezequiel J. Marchesini","Zoë McGrath","Conor M. B. Omand","Eliana Palazzi","Daniel A. Perley","Andrea Rossi","Killa Santer","Jesper Sollerman","Chiara Ventura","Jacob L. Wise","Tracy X. Chen","Steven L. Groom","Mansi M. Kasliwal","Josiah Purdum"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文报告了首颗强透镜型Ⅰ超亮超新星SN 2025wny（红移z=2.015）的光度时间延迟测量，通过GausSN高斯过程回归模型从多设施grizJ波段光变曲线中推断出图像间的时间延迟，结合透镜模型测得H₀，展示了强透镜超新星作为独立宇宙学探针的潜力。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28427","score":92,"stars":5,"tier":"must-read","mandatory":true,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"gravitational lens modelling","points":28}],"must_read_reason":"strong gravitational lensing","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2609.03089","canonical_id":"2609.03089","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"TDCOSMO XXIX: JWST/NIRSpec IFU Spatially Resolved Kinematics of Three Time-delay Lenses","authors":["Shawn Knabel","Pritom Mozumdar","Anowar J. Shajib","Tommaso Treu","Devon M. Williams","Michele Cappellari","David Law","Simon Birrer","Takahiro Morishita","William Sheu","Massimo Stiavelli"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO","astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"该论文利用JWST-NIRSpec积分场光谱提取了三个四重透镜类星体系统（HE0435-1223、PG1115+080、WFI2033-4723）中偏转星系的二维空间分辨恒星运动学，其平均每bin总不确定度为6-11%，相邻bin间相关性误差仅约1.2%。与之前TDCOSMO分析相比，孔径积分速度弥散在统计上一致（均在0.9σ内），平均不确定度从3.7%降至2.4%。研究将PG1115+080归类为快速旋转星系，另两个为慢速旋转星系，并为即将发布的TDCOSMO 2026宇宙学参数测量提供关键数据。","date":"2026-09-04","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.03089","score":95,"stars":5,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"high-redshift galaxy dynamics","points":34}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing","High-redshift Galaxy Dynamics"]},{"id":"2608.28413","canonical_id":"2608.28413","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Follow-up of SN 2025wny I: Space-based Observations of the First Multiply-imaged Superluminous Supernova","authors":["Ariel Goobar","Joel Johansson","Edvard Mörtsell","Cameron Lemon","Steve Schulze","Suhail Dhawan","Alice Townsend","Maggie L. Li","Yu-Jing Qin","Lin Yan","Christoffer Fremling","Mansi M. Kasliwal","Peter Nugent","Graham P. Smith","Jesper Sollerman","Igor Andreoni","Nikki Arendse","Thomas E. Collett","Jakob Nordin","Jacob Osman Hjortlund","Daniel A. Perley","Mickael Rigault","Stephen Thorp","Jacob L. Wise"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文介绍了SN 2025wny，这是首个被强引力透镜化的超亮I型超新星（SLSN-I），红移z=2.0151，被两个星系透镜成五重像。通过HST和JWST的联合观测，获取了精确的天体测量、多波段测光和光谱数据，为超新星性质研究、透镜建模和时间延迟宇宙学（测量H0）提供了观测基础。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28413","score":88,"stars":5,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.28416","canonical_id":"2608.28416","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Follow-up of SN 2025wny III: Spectroscopic Time-delay Measurements of a Strongly Gravitationally Lensed Superluminous Supernova","authors":["Joel Johansson","Edvard Mörtsell","Ariel Goobar","Steve Schulze","Maggie L. Li","Yu-Jing Qin","Lin Yan","Hannah C. Turner","Suhail Dhawan","Alice Townsend","Jakob Nordin","Aleksandra Bochenek","Malte Busmann","Kaustav K. Das","Christoffer Fremling","Lluis Galbany","Alexa C. Gordon","Daniel Gruen","Mansi M. Kasliwal","Chang Liu","Zoë McGrath","Christopher Martin","Peter Massey","Martijn S. S. L. Oei","Daniel A. Perley","Andrés I. Ponte Pérez","Francisco Prada","Nikolaus Z. Prusinski","Nabeel Rehemtulla","R. Michael Rich","Surya Shivaprasad","Jesper Sollerman","Jacob L. Wise"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO"],"summary":"本文报告了首个空间分辨的强引力透镜超亮超新星SN 2025wny（红移z=2.015）的光谱观测，利用高斯过程建模追踪光谱特征的时间演化，测量了多个像之间的时间延迟，并结合透镜模型给出了哈勃常数H0 = 70.2^{+8.2}_{-6.1} km/s/Mpc。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.28416","score":85,"stars":4,"tier":"recommended","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[{"label":"strong gravitational lensing","points":55},{"label":"gravitational lens modelling","points":28}],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Strong Gravitational Lensing"]},{"id":"2608.27560","canonical_id":"2608.27560","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Resolved Dust in $z\\approx1$ Galaxies with JWST/MIRI MRS: Survey Description and First View on PAHs, Mid-IR Atomic Emission, and Warm H$_2$","authors":["Wuji Wang","Andreas L. Faisst","Thomas S. -Y. Lai","Kyle Finner","Jed McKinney","Andrew J. Battisti","Irene Shivaei","Leindert A. Boogaard","Daizhong Liu","Yu-Heng Lin","Lun-Jun Liu","Georgios Magdis","Vincenzo Mainieri","Alexander Rodriguez","John D. Silverman","Zhaoxuan Liu","Minju M. Lee","Ghassem Gozaliasl","Maximilien Franco"],"categories":["astro-ph.GA"],"summary":"该研究利用JWST/MIRI MRS首次对8个z≈1星系中的PAH（多环芳香烃）和红外发射线进行高分辨率空间分辨观测，揭示了PAH的尺寸、电荷状态及空间分布特征，并发现AGN和合并星系中中性PAH比例更高，中心PAH颗粒更大且电离程度更低，初步揭示了PAH随宇宙演化的潜在趋势。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27560","score":85,"stars":4,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Dust and ISM"]},{"id":"2608.27557","canonical_id":"2608.27557","version_count":1,"previous_versions":[],"title":"Discovering Substellar Dark Matter Halos with Astrometric Weak Lensing of Multiply Imaged Quasars","authors":["Ken Van Tilburg","David E. Kaplan"],"categories":["astro-ph.CO","astro-ph.GA","hep-ph"],"summary":"本文提出利用多重成像类星体的时域天文测量弱引力透镜效应来探测亚恒星级暗物质晕，可将透镜灵敏度扩展到现有最小暗物质结构的12-14个数量级以下，并对两个基准系统进行了十年观测计划的灵敏度预测。","date":"2026-08-31","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27557","score":62,"stars":3,"tier":"archive","mandatory":false,"score_breakdown":[],"must_read_reason":"","topics":["Other Selected Research"]}],"must_read":[{"id":"2608.30079","canonical_id":"